[{"title":"子建自楚归过访","author":"居节","text":"湘君庙下鹧鸪啼，芳草王孙去路迷。\n春水看消巴蜀雪，桃花游遍武陵溪。\n朝云梦里江南路，风雨灯前夜半鸡。\n归到故园秋未老，一尊还唱白铜鞮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5351,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"洵美濒行携歌姬过山中言别阻雨不赴因简以诗","author":"居节","text":"公子临行出翠鬟，新歌能解唱阳关。\n不嫌杜牧三觥后，生怕周郎一顾间。\n纨扇芙蓉隔秋水，枕屏云雨自青山。\n烛花影里银筝畔，谁见惊鸿向月还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5352,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"听雨遣怀二首 其一","author":"居节","text":"琴樽几杖静柴门，抱瓮忘机老灌园。\n不遇曾闻七十说，出关空著五千言。\n高云暮色霜前雁，独树孤烟原上村。\n零落楚兰愁未采，一江风雨泣秋魂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5353,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"听雨遣怀二首 其二","author":"居节","text":"一番秋事老芙蕖，萧飒寒生暮雨余。\n村巷犬声如吠豹，邻家灯影有归渔。\n重阳酒熟萸初紫，五柳霜清叶未疏。\n卖赋虚名吾岂有，向来多病似相如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5354,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题简洵美","author":"居节","text":"绿鬟欹堕翠蛾愁，蜡烛高烧花满楼。\n箫起玉台双引凤，星回银汉一牵牛。\n茱萸匣里常藏月，豆蔻枝头不作秋。\n昨日江枫吹叶紫，横塘无复采莲舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5355,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮归书事","author":"居节","text":"竹溪萝径自幽清，片片山衣细霭生。\n薄暮园庐半烟火，高原禾黍正秋晴。\n遥看绿酒悬帘卖，未办青钱挂杖行。\n新月柴门牛背笛，澹云红树总诗情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5356,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨夜闻雁","author":"居节","text":"缸斜寒照竹，山静雨围床。\n雁到秋如许，人愁夜未央。\n江天将只影，霜信过重阳。\n小梦知何处，三湘烟水长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5357,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"简克承丈","author":"居节","text":"临顿东头水竹居，路人尽识隐君庐。\n墨香小研磨铜雀，芸草残编辟蠹鱼。\n白首尚玄犹自苦，黄花对酒近何如。\n青山尽有萧闲事，欲寄芭蕉不可书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5358,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题四首戏呈孝甫子建 其一","author":"居节","text":"高楼月色白于霜，画枕屏寒夜未央。\n织女机丝隔河汉，娥皇竹泪满潇湘。\n双飞自托云中鹄，一曲空弹《陌上桑》。\n妒女津头潮不到，江流却似九回肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5359,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题四首戏呈孝甫子建 其二","author":"居节","text":"玉椷消息滞天涯，零落银筝雁柱斜。\n罗䋭无尘生雒水，春云有梦到章华。\n晓星明处疑为月，霜叶红时认作花。\n人说莫愁吾不信，石城何路问伊家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5360,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题四首戏呈孝甫子建 其三","author":"居节","text":"塞鸿声断草虫啼，银烛熏笼坐不辞。\n蛱蝶画罗捐扇日，鸳鸯裁绮授衣时。\n秦家树上乌栖早，韩掾墙边月到迟。\n黛绿暗销人去远，章台无柳斗双眉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5361,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题四首戏呈孝甫子建 其四","author":"居节","text":"兰灯光里织流黄，断续柔丝断续肠。\n不恨紫槽常抱月，最怜绿绮解求凰。\n屏风自隔春云热，海水新添夜漏长。\n宋玉多才能作赋，至今人说梦高唐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5362,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对酒","author":"居节","text":"三杯莫惜瘦颜酡，百岁其如半去何。\n炼尽少年风月在，剩留余事病愁多。\n沧江倦客新黄发，空谷佳人旧翠蛾。\n竺国蓬山那可问，醉乡深处且婆娑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5363,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邻农以麦饭菜羹见饷","author":"居节","text":"来縳作饭菜为羹，惭愧山农饷我情。\n一饱年来非易得，五湖无地可躬耕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5364,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岁暮山村二首 其一","author":"居节","text":"清霜红日满高林，烟火萧疏灌莽深。\n欲和楚吟无《白雪》，能生壮色少黄金。\n尝饥俊鹘呼风过，不雨寒云起夕阴。\n何事悲欢却成疾，如灰已冷少年心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5365,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岁暮山村二首 其二","author":"居节","text":"落木寒云知几重，枇杷花下鹿麋踪。\n家贫伏腊犹无计，山静朝昏惟有钟。\n雨雪短衣凋薜荔，风尘长剑暗芙蓉。\n悠然抱膝歌《梁甫》，伊吕之间是卧龙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5366,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对雪","author":"居节","text":"老树荒村鸟雀稀，隔溪茅屋午烟微。\n黄云压地门深闭，积雪满山樵未归。\n一树梅花闲觅句，十年湖海叹无衣。\n钓鱼却忆披蓑客，小艇寒江兴不违。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5367,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟行书事","author":"居节","text":"沧江无数白鸥群，欹枕渔歌杳杳闻。\n断港浅浮消雪水，薄阴微敛护霜云。\n鸡鸣渐觉人家近，木落遥看浦溆分。\n茶灶笔床舟一叶，布帆影里见斜曛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5368,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟中梦后月明江清怅然有怀","author":"居节","text":"月吐青山夜四更，梦回酒醒正寒生。\n满空霜色白于雪，绕枕江流细有声。\n蚕茧纸新教写字，龙香火暖听吹笙。\n少年场上春游骑，葑水桃花旧日情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5369,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿道院","author":"居节","text":"解橐神仙宅，青萝小洞房。\n何人识紫气，无梦熟黄粱。\n床拂如云石，帘飞似水霜。\n不知寒漏永，消尽读经香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5370,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初春书事（戊寅）","author":"居节","text":"青萝小屋绿莎墙，腊后梅花已试香。\n一斗东邻买桑落，千金北客问干将。\n读书研破鱼生釜，卧雪斋虚月到床。\n欲识溪头春几许，新波新柳似鹅黄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5371,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"枫桥夜泊","author":"居节","text":"渔火宿江村，何人识此情。\n变名张俭老，去国蔡雍轻。\n独树桥头雨，寒钟夜半声。\n春洲有归雁，无那暗魂惊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5372,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"酒次与吴文学","author":"居节","text":"对酒无言兴尽还，豆花棚下有青山。\n明朝欲钓鲈鱼去，君若来时恐未闲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5373,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中口占","author":"居节","text":"年年抱病足中秋，明月无缘酒有仇。\n几两阮宣新蜡屐，一篷鲁望旧操舟。\n飞鸿阁外山如画，斫鲙亭前水自流。\n料得此时相忆者，冷猿独鹤与驯鸥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5374,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋来未登寺阁病中想见其景物幽胜诗简一开士","author":"居节","text":"阁锁空寥秋未攀，风烟宛在画图间。\n澹霞斜日半江色，湿翠空云初齐山。\n落雁沙头孤笛起，采菱渡口一舟还。\n欲扶残病来看月，莫遣知寮早上关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5375,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"壬午元旦","author":"居节","text":"钟鼓高城送腊徂，云霞曙色上桃符。\n日随岁月开三始，春与莺花到五湖。\n借宅南山非捷径，对人故态是狂奴。\n依然旧识东风面，柳眼青青向酒垆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5376,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中简王德操","author":"居节","text":"有美乌衣秀，神情朗复疏。\n能为《鲁灵赋》，善拓会稽书。\n江雨钩帘暮，梨花对酒初。\n诗成犹未写，待子问何如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5377,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过陆华甫西溪草堂","author":"居节","text":"乌目山头客，铜官住十年。\n艺兰春满畹，种秫雨连田。\n鸭斗溪西草，茶飘竹外烟。\n阴阴门柳色，不隔渡头船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5378,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"姚山人携酒同过陆园看梅花","author":"居节","text":"十亩芳园傍水涯，药阑莎径抱山斜。\n绿瓷小瓮携春酒，乌角高巾对玉花。\n漠漠暗香留月色，萧萧白发醉年华。\n如何甫里天随宅，却是西湖处士家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5379,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谷日感怀","author":"居节","text":"谷日条风喜及晴，东皋南陇已春生。\n少从剑客游三辅，老傍田家卜五行。\n衣食有端终岁计，江山信美故园情。\n蹉跎十亩桑阴地，惭愧花林鸟劝耕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5380,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题二首 其一","author":"居节","text":"坐倚熏笼火尚温，钟鸣高阁又黄昏。\n梅花雪后门半掩，豆蔻枝头月一痕。\n漫说倾城岂颜色，曾闻化石是精魂。\n寄君茶碾湘江竹，犹有娥皇泪点存。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5381,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"无题二首 其二","author":"居节","text":"力薄慵梳十八鬟，梦回谁与说双鸾。\n鹅儿酒嫩堪成醉，云母屏凉不障寒。\n芳草都从行处长，春山岂是画时残。\n金鱼笺纸回文句，昨夜灯前仔细看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5382,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春寒","author":"居节","text":"重楼燕子隔天涯，五柳阴疏未聚鸦。\n十日春寒淹雨雪，几番风信到梨花。\n横塘水长听莺处，小巷泥深卖酒家。\n多少朱门咽弦管，沉香火底按琵琶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5383,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梦后作","author":"居节","text":"酒醒天涯春几分，绿琴惆怅昔年闻。\n海棠无信作寒食，梦雨何心入断云。\n石竹短襦留半臂，秋香小字记双文。\n浔阳江上潮难到，此夜花前忽见君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5384,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春晴书见","author":"居节","text":"金羁芳草去翩翩，王谢儿郎美少年。\n雨水已过正月后，莺花不隔短筇前。\n春云拟黛山千叠，画阁笼烟柳半天。\n燕子未来寒食远，谁家庭院试秋千。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5385,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有怀湖上张文学","author":"居节","text":"冷落湖头白鸟期，青莲艇子去迟迟。\n柳应拂水今几尺，杏已开花可满枝。\n病起故人谁载酒，春来何处最宜诗。\n欲知雨后千山色，总似张郎新画眉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5386,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日有怀","author":"居节","text":"柴门春水浴沙凫，袅袅垂杨短短蒲。\n花勒浅寒迎燕子，雨将新绿入蘼芜。\n焚鱼学士谁招隐，放鹤仙人不可呼。\n欲听黄鹂过桥去，隔烟小鸟唤提壶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5387,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春昼","author":"居节","text":"泥香江暖燕来时，红白花深桃李枝。\n草色一帘门半掩，卧看双蝶趁游丝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5388,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春寒","author":"居节","text":"春欲分时寒更深，阑风伏雨昼阴阴。\n不通燕子重帘闭，憔悴花枝病酒心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5389,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新晴寺阁","author":"居节","text":"苦潦愁霖思不禁，偶梯香阁出丛林。\n酒旗巷陌桃花遍，燕子人家春水深。\n独鸟自飞吴苑树，千山不尽楚江阴。\n清明已近芳菲日，鼓角偏伤迟暮心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5390,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚晴简姚伯容","author":"居节","text":"曲薄斜扉带远林，鹁鸪啼彻昼阴阴。\n雨催春色二分过，水长桃花十尺深。\n江上片帆斜日影，天涯芳草踏青心。\n料君闭户焚香处，道性知来为听琴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5391,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄秦侍御","author":"居节","text":"寥落芳时卧病情，闭门草色唤愁生。\n莺花春老青山雨，鼓角风高铁瓮城。\n剑气却从何处吐，鸡声偏向梦中惊。\n西台御史能无意，想见临觞醉不成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5392,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春暮睡起","author":"居节","text":"避俗年来聊避喧，移家犹未问桃源。\n雨晴门巷皆山色，花落春衣半酒痕。\n身在江湖谁是客，心空梦幻已忘言。\n游丝柳絮偏无赖，遍逐东风去绕村。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5393,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王雅适久居金陵过访山中因赠","author":"居节","text":"春遍天涯芳草多，王孙裘马意如何。\n髻鬟山好初收雨，罗绮江平暮不波。\n韦曲花前千日醉，杜鹃声里片帆过。\n秋清拟泛秦淮月，与尔同听《玉树》歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5394,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中","author":"居节","text":"习性未能忘，摊书日满床。\n四邻分树色，一径借溪光。\n听雨支高枕，下帘留晚香。\n萧闲生意在，庭草过人长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5395,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"仲夏闲居","author":"居节","text":"树底柴门不浪开，松钗竹粉半青苔。\n绿分田水新栽稻，黄入园林已熟梅。\n小艇送僧笼鹤去，片云载雨过湖来。\n夕阳山好诗难就，夜合花前费讨裁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5396,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新秋雨后夜坐","author":"居节","text":"山萤一点拂衣流，茉莉花开香暗浮。\n河汉影斜初过雨，井桐凉堕已迎秋。\n玉笙小院当年月，纨扇长门昨夜愁。\n惆怅瑶芳易凋谢，美人何处独登楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5397,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日书怀寄吴惟范","author":"居节","text":"十年握手愧君知，澒洞风尘鬓已丝。\n元叔倚门终肮脏，长卿慢世自栖迟。\n过河独抱枯鱼泣，斫地空歌老骥诗。\n陇首云飞秋色起，江湖又是雁来时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5398,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日早起","author":"居节","text":"虫声半掩筚门空，短发朝来不受风。\n日出山光落衣桁，雨余秋色在梧桐。\n蹉跎海岳孤筇外，荏苒年华一镜中。\n万事浮云多变灭，莫将衰泪泣途穷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5399,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中甫过斋中烹茗清谈试笔写图因题其上三首 其一","author":"居节","text":"落尽花藤涧水香，松风如水昼初长。\n幽人自是山中相，鹤氅黄冠坐夕阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5400,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中甫过斋中烹茗清谈试笔写图因题其上三首 其二","author":"居节","text":"莲社疏钟报晓晴，青山落日映江明。\n一番红紫春归后，新绿如云绕径生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5401,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中甫过斋中烹茗清谈试笔写图因题其上三首 其三","author":"居节","text":"满城车马看春忙，君独携琴顾草堂。\n我亦兴来扶病坐，鼠须闲吮墨花香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5402,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴门春游曲四首 其一","author":"居节","text":"濠上花深翡翠楼，楼前白月涌江流。\n香风两岸笙歌合，夜夜烧灯照客舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5403,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴门春游曲四首 其二","author":"居节","text":"禁烟将近暖风微，桃李阴阴燕子飞。\n好向西虹游墅去，薄罗小扇夹纱衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5404,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴门春游曲四首 其三","author":"居节","text":"春江花月满春烟，夜夜琵琶宿画船。\n城上乌啼霜又落，紫檀槽暖不成眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5405,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴门春游曲四首 其四","author":"居节","text":"谁家年少恣春游，翠幄朱旗三橹舟。\n齐唱棹歌江似沸，黄莺啼杀不回头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5406,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岁暮","author":"居节","text":"凄凄风色紧，鸡犬静柴门。\n田野无它事，溪山有此村。\n暮寒深白屋，邻语近黄昏。\n且复篝灯坐，空怜齿发存。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5407,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪中再送玄搢","author":"居节","text":"金昌西望即天涯，寒满扁舟去路赊。\n瓜步沙头莫回首，一江风雪似杨花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5408,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"重题自画小景赠戴子文去画时四十年矣","author":"居节","text":"点染青山四十年，寸缣不改旧风烟。\n散人漫窃江湖号，未买松江一钓船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5409,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西苑志感","author":"张凤翼","text":"芙蓉别殿未央西，炉气晨飘雉尾齐。\n出洛神龟将宝箓，衔花驯鹿绕金闺。\n近臣拾翠供玄草，使者乘骢访碧鸡。\n一自六龙天上去，几回清禁改璇题。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5410,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梨花","author":"张凤翼","text":"重门寂寂锁香云，雨滴空阶坐夜分。\n老去微之风调在，折来何处与双文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5411,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题柳","author":"张凤翼","text":"千丝千树拂天津，三起三眠出上林。\n何似小桃低曲处，一枝斜覆玉窗深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5412,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"北苑怀归","author":"张凤翼","text":"帝里春深淑气迟，天街无路踏香泥。\n逢人客坐三分话，到处官衙一局棋。\n叔夜不堪徒自遣，马卿多病欲何之。\n归时若遇高阳侣，有酒如渑醉肯辞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5413,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十五夜月","author":"刘凤","text":"明月炤沧海，清辉盈此时。\n似规流素魄，持粉俪新姿。\n波泻沦河影，榆寒露鹊枝。\n与君同万里，无那独含思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5414,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"昭台怨二首 其一","author":"刘凤","text":"妾意怜芳树，君恩疏桂宫。\n梦回清瑟断，燕去画梁空。\n慢脸羞铅翠，颦蛾减黛红。\n琐闱花半落，尽日闭春风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5415,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"昭台怨二首 其二","author":"刘凤","text":"玉舆行幸绝，朱陛暗青苔。\n不分恩成故，犹持宠自猜。\n薄寒生碧雾，流叶下丹台。\n唾井终捐弃，清尘岂重回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5416,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"芙蓉楼送客","author":"刘凤","text":"醉酒高楼此别君，袖中萱草惜斜曛。\n月明水上如相忆，寄取潇湘数片云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5417,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和夜上受降城闻笛","author":"刘凤","text":"北斗低垂挂戍楼，黄河不逐月西流。\n一声长笛冲沙起，散作边人万里愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":5418,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]